 Ltd. (51%)'' as not consolidated for materiality, so the legal entity may be a small, partly-owned company distinct from the Beit Haemek production business.', 'high', 'Israeli entity confirmed on manufacturer''s contact and subsidiaries pages; Labotal''s exclusivity for balances is self-reported.', 'company', 'verified');
