ings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', 'medium', 'Israel distributor (Ornat) is supported by one credible third-party listing quoting the distributor itself, not by NEB''s own country list; size figures unavailable (private).', 'estimate', 'verified');
