 opened and some Hebrew searches could not be run. Size figures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', 'low', 'Israel channel could not be determined (locator not accessible, Hebrew search not run); size figures recalled from filings.', 'company', 'partial');
