 searches and all page fetches (WebFetch/curl) were blocked, so manufacturer distributor/contact pages could not be opened and some Hebrew searches could not be run. Size figures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', 'low', 'Israel research incomplete (single search, no Hebrew search, no manufacturer page); private company without published revenue.', 'company', 'partial');
