ures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', 'low', 'Official distributor list excerpt omits Israel (suggesting no distributor / direct coverage) but the page could not be read in full; size figures recalled.', 'estimate', 'partial');
