 so a Hach-listed Israeli partner may exist but could not be confirmed. The brief''s hint of a possible Hach-owned Israeli entity was not verified either way.', 'low', 'Identity/ownership from Wikipedia and Veralto page extracts; size figures from memory (unverified); Israel result is a negative after limited searching with no access to Hach''s distributor locator.', 'company', 'partial');
